00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.190 line:10%
grandstands, she won't meet,

00:07:58.190 --> 00:07:59.510 line:10%
she won't compromise,

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:01.530 line:10%
she won't even allow a vote,

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:02.990 line:10%
then Americans will have all

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:04.340 line:10%
the information they need

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:05.360 line:10%
to make an informed

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:06.830 line:10%
choice in November

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:08.960 line:10%
and inoculate the United States

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:09.980 line:10%
from the Democrats'

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:13.130 line:10%
virus of failed leadership.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:15.230 line:10%
Remember, a President Biden,

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:17.270 line:10%
