00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.500 line:10%
certain, not less certain,

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.300 line:10%
that we're

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.290 line:10%
dependent on the very country

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:22.760 line:10%
that allowed this virus

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:24.890 line:10%
to spread, China.

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:26.940 line:10%
And that is not the way to go.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.870 line:90%
And that's the angle.

